      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/strykersville_new_york",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Late‑19th‑century farms in Strykersville grew wheat, hops, apples, and dairy, feeding a cheese factory that produced 55 tons yearly.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
